          },
          {
            "slot": "s546",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · Lip Recharge provides a soft shine fin…",
            "text": "Lip Recharge provides a soft shine finish. It's not as glossy as a traditional lip gloss, but leaves lips with a subtle amount of shine that looks healthy and hydrated.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          },
          {
