            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          },
          {
            "slot": "s560",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · Lip Recharge comes in 9 universal, cas…",
            "text": "Lip Recharge comes in 9 universal, casually sheer shades that anyone can wear. Even shades that look brighter, like Lilac, will sheer out once applied and leave a wash of color that never looks overdone. You can't go wrong with these shades.",
