            "repere": "Paragraphe · What makes Lip Recharge different from…",
            "text": "What makes Lip Recharge different from traditional lip gloss?",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          },
          {
            "slot": "s567",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · Lip Recharge is different from traditi…",
            "text": "Lip Recharge is different from traditional lip glosses in that it features a more skincare-forward formula than a cosmetic lip product does. It's powered by high-performance ingredients like moisture-boosting peptides, vitamin E, and shea butter. While it does add a flattering hint of color to your looks, it's also working hard to hydrate, smooth, and soften lips as you wear it.",
